$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> In Orbit around Malery's World" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName1> has captured a <vServer::teamName1> dropship and using some old FF codes have managed to dock with the <vServer::teamName1> dropship in orbit around the planet.  With most of it's troops on the planet it is extremely vulnerable.";